{"id":"schliesslich","lemma":"schließlich","pos":"adv","rank":992,"glosses":["in the end, finally, eventually","after all (because of, for the reason)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃliːslɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/De-schlie%C3%9Flich.ogg/De-schlie%C3%9Flich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Schließlich kamen wir im Dorf an.","en":"At last, we arrived at the village.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"village"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Schließlich fand ich einen Job.","en":"Finally, I found a job.","words":[null,{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"job"}]},{"text":"Schließlich hattest du recht.","en":"You were right after all.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"right, right-hand"}]},{"text":"Du wirst schließlich Erfolg haben.","en":"You'll succeed in the end.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"success"},{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Der Mörder wurde schließlich letzte Nacht gefangen.","en":"The murderer was finally caught last night.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"murderer"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"last"},{"g":"night"},{"g":"caught"}]}]}